# Place your Google Play Developer API service-account JSON here as:
#   android/play-store-service-account.json
#
# Create it:
#   1. Google Cloud Console → create service account → download JSON key
#   2. Play Console → Setup → API access → link the Cloud project
#   3. Grant the service account "Release to production / testing" (or Admin)
#   4. Copy the JSON file to android/play-store-service-account.json
#
# Or set env: PLAY_STORE_JSON_KEY=C:\path\to\key.json
